  "description": "*“Father, please go to prison in my place.\"*\n\nOn the day before his wedding, Ryu Seo-ho, a team leader in insurance assessment, kills someone in a drowsy‑driving accident. The person he turns to in order to cover up the incident is his father — a man he cut ties with 15 years ago. But from that day on, their false conspiracy begins to dredge up the long‑buried truth of the past that had been hidden for those 15 years.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
